                        <li><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check"></i> Horsepower</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check"></i> Automatic Climate Control</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check"></i> Touchscreen Display</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check"></i> Navigation System</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check"></i> Fog Lights</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h2 class="mb--30">Your Trusted Partner in Car Buying and Service</h2>
                    <p class="mb--30">Welcome to Career Compass, your ultimate destination for career advice, job search strategies, and big to an a professional development insights. Whether you're a recent graduate, seasoned professional, or someone considering a career change, our blog is your trusted guide to help you navigate the ever-evolving landscape of the job market.</p>
