                            <img src="~/assets/images/testimonials/quote-04.svg" alt="">
                        </div>
                        Contrary to popular belief, Lorem Ipsum is not simply random text. It has roots in a piece of classical Latin literature from 45 BC, making it over 2000 years old. Richard McClintock, a Latin professor at Hampden-Sydney College in Virginia <img src="~/assets/images/testimonials/quote-04.svg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <p class="mb--40">At Career Compass, we understand that finding the right career path can be daunting. That's why we offer a wealth of resources to empower you on your journey. From resume writing tips and interview techniques to networking advice and skill-building strategies, our expert contributors share their knowledge and expertise to equip you with the tools you need to succeed.</p>
